{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39757","headline":"輙吟七言四韵攀寄翁文尧拾遗 · 黄滔","name":"輙吟七言四韵攀寄翁文尧拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"唐设高科表用文，吾曹谁作谏垣臣。\n甄山秀气旷千古，凤阙华恩锺二人。\n起草便论天上事，如君不是世间身。\n龙头龙尾前年梦，今日须怜应若神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39757.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39757","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}